#: oldman/db/migrations/commands.py:630
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Retire App %(app)s: keep tables %(tables)s, remove migration head "
"%(head)s, and clear its Registry rows. Afterward remove package "
"%(package)s from service files %(files)s and from migration_apps if "
"present."
msgstr ""
"停用 App %(app)s：保留資料表 %(tables)s，移除遷移頭 %(head)s，並清除它在 Registry "
"中的記錄。之後從服務設定檔 %(files)s 和 migration_apps（如果有）中移除套件 %(package)s。"

