#, python-format
msgid "Type App label %(app)s to retire permanently"
msgstr "輸入 App 標籤 %(app)s 以永久停用"

#: oldman/db/migrations/commands.py:708
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Recovery will stamp source heads %(heads)s and restore Registry rows "
"%(rows)s. Tables without current models remain external: %(external)s. "
"Oldman cannot prove that arbitrary blank revisions or data operations "
"ran; continuing asserts that the current database already matches the "
"source heads. Recovery will not run business migration DDL."
msgstr ""
"恢復會把原始碼中的遷移頭 %(heads)s 記為已執行，並恢復 Registry 記錄 "
"%(rows)s。目前沒有模型的資料表保持為外部資料表：%(external)s。Oldman "
"無法證明任意空白遷移版本或資料操作已經執行過；繼續即表示你確認目前資料庫已與原始碼的遷移頭一致。恢復不會執行業務遷移的 DDL。"

